WEBVTT

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:37.400
Hello again! My name is Dr. Riddles, the extraordinary doctor who knows everything!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.210
Now then, Maestro's master plan of revenge took everyone by surprise!

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:46.520
I see. I thought he was scheming something, but this?

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.190
I never thought you were planning to overtake the Momoto world.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.490
The play is over!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:55.180
Let's have the cast whose roles have ended!

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.580
Please leave the stage immediately!

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.830
Go, Zack Sekerga!

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:07.370
I realized Maestro had the ability to control magnetic power.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:11.040
This ends right now!

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.240
It's not over yet!

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:20.010
It appeared that Sherry and Rago's attack had contained Maestro once and for all.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.160
However...

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:25.330
Dioga Gravidon!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:28.050
Did they do it?

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:30.000
Hehehehehe!

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:31.710
He's... not hurt?

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:35.670
Then, Kiyo devises a plan.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:42.550
Where Satch and Brago fight together?

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:48.070
Don't think that this means I've forgiven you for burning Majuro's book, Brago.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:49.570
I won't.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:50.960
Let's go!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:58.320
The decisive battle in the in-between world.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.350
The door is open!

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.720
The entrance to the Momodo world.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:17.610
The visitors from the human world that Maestro spoke of.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:22.240
I guess they finally did it.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:29.590
Garouk!

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:40.890
This new alliance of yours is no match for me!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:44.140
Gro!

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.210
He he he he!

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:45.840
What?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:18.860
Strength is evidence, which is why it's no surprise you're powerful enough to open the door to the Momodo world.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:28.230
Stop your crying. Here he comes.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:30.000
Magnetion!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.110
Let's go!

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:34.180
Right!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:37.020
They're working great together!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:41.160
I'm feeling really confident about them teaming up with each other!

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:44.610
Unfortunately, we have no margin for error.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:51.830
I tried resting up while you guys were fighting Maestro, but it looks like it's still going to take some more time for me to recover my strength from within.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:58.480
So I'm sorry, Sherry, but you're going to have to carry out the bulk of our strategy alone until I can regain my strength.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:03:59.640
Don't worry about it.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.320
should be able to hold down the fort for a while until we can team up at full

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.520
strength leave it to me you just do what you need to do

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:15.290
thanks sherry and I want you to know I'm not just setting you up against the

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:29.090
enemy so I won't have to face you myself one day you better not be look sherry

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:30.000
didn't even use

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:34.520
No spell? What other powers do you have?

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:39.210
Will you two ever stop being so naïve?

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.230
I built these amplification coils to enhance my power

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:47.630
and supplement the extra energy I lacked in order to open the door to the Momodo world.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:53.650
If I use the power of the coils, then I can handle the both of you at the same time without using spells.

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:57.290
Like this!

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:00.000
It's not just about power for me.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:05.810
runs deeper! You will not stand in my way for revenge on the Momoto world!

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:07.780
Magnet Shiruga!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.810
Ahhhh!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:16.380
Ah, f***ing about me!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:22.100
Too strong! We're at too big a disadvantage! There's no chance of beating him in close

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.010
combat!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:30.000
Yeah, I know, but what should we do? I'm still drained. The chances of us winning with the

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:41.810
am now is probably only about 50/50. There might be one chance, but failure won't be an option.

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:44.800
Huh? Ponygon!

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.480
*gibberish*

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.090
Are you okay?

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:49.880
Matter!

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:54.000
Huh.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.130
*gibberish*

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:58.750
Hmm.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.760
*gibberish*

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:11.180
sherry time for phase two of the strategy leave it to me let's go counter-attack

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:19.460
zats move back okay brago forward still this futile resistance hey maestro

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:28.200
try resisting this if you can very well

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:50.350
The shield has been powered up to many times its original strength by the surrounding coils.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:51.920
You gotta race!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.480
It's about TIME you gave up!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.590
ION GRUDDY RAIN!

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.880
Heheheheh!

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:12.660
Hahahaha!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:19.240
Dyl, is it there yet?

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:23.890
That's it! The coils have reached their maximum capacity!

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:26.700
Good enough, Keo?

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.100
That should be just perfect!

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:34.070
So, I see you finally decided to give up?

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:35.470
That!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.330
Huh?

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.370
Right!

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:41.040
You are all such poor losers!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:48.000
Sorry that our attitude doesn't fit into your plans, but the thing is, we have no intention of losing!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.620
Right!

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.730
The seventh spell!

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:54.480
The Gunza!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.880
Magnet Shield!

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:30.000
new spell, but the same result. Sherry! Way! They were able

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:37.410
shatter my shield I knew it no matter how strong the shield they all have their

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:41.790
weak spot hit that point just right and it all comes crashing down using a spell

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.270
to gauge the limit of the coils and then combining the spells to smash the

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:50.700
enemy shield I have to hand it to kill that's a pretty good strategy it's not

00:08:50.700 --> 00:09:00.000
just about power for us either maestro for us it runs deeper never face that level

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:05.000
but I am not going to lose to those two!

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.000
Zagurzam!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.980
It's over. Finish him!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.310
Got it. I'll detonate the Zagurzam.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:14.780
That!

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.780
Right!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.650
Zagurga!

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:22.760
Possible!

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:33.970
Ah!

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:37.240
I was waiting for this to happen all along!

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:44.240
The coils absorbed your spell and provided the final power needed to completely open the door!

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:51.030
There's nothing to stop him now!

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:54.350
Good!

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:59.780
Now the Momodo world is as good as Concord!

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:25.060
We'll also be able to use spells again if we go to the Momodo world.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.840
Yeah, let's tear the place to shreds when we get there.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:45.260
will gather here preparing to invade the momodo world at the moment they can only use mock spells

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:50.410
but once they're back in the momodo world they will be at full power again i would like to commend

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:55.930
all of you for managing to survive against me to this point but now your time is over prepare to be

00:10:55.930 --> 00:11:00.000
destroyed individually each soldier isn't strong

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:03.450
but there are so many of them.

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:06.510
Can we really take on a whole army while fighting Maestro

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:09.150
at the same time?

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:13.420
It's too bad, because you guys do have promise.

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:15.520
How about joining me in my conquest

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.750
to conquer the Momodo world?

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.590
In return, I promise you a generous reward.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.550
There's no way I'd join you.

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:24.730
That's too bad.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:28.430
What about you, Brago?

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.000
Brago, don't tell me

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:36.570
Forget it, maestro. His answer is no.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:37.810
What's that?

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:42.150
I told you. I'm going to make Brago king.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.900
Sherry is absolutely right.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:51.240
I got too discouraged before. There's only one thing for me to do now.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.020
I'm going to help Zatch become a kind king.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:55.880
Yeah!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:12:00.000
A bunch of smart-alit humans and foolish Momodo.

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:04.920
Very well! Then you can just be destroyed here and now!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:09.120
I'd call on my army to gather together and smash these fools!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.080
So that there's not one speck of dust left!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.960
Ready for phase three?

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.860
Yeah!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:20.800
Picano Magne Shield!

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.520
Weaklings, your time is almost up!

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:25.320
Now, Zack!

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.250
Okay!

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.420
Drago!

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:28.200
Right!

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:31.290
Here we go!

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:32.740
Come on!

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:46.460
If I can withstand their last attack, I win!

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:47.460
It worked!

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:55.860
Now, on to the Momodo world!

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:58.200
Sherry, do it!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.230
SHIDO DURANGA!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:30.000
Zakerga is weakening from the

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:38.880
strength of Maestro's counterspell. Even so, we must not lose. Maestro, you didn't think

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:43.740
human partners were necessary for Momodo in the in-between world. We'll show you.

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:47.340
We're going back to our world. Our thoughts are now won.

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:57.620
What now?

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:03.870
It's black?

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.480
The Vav Sekerga!

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:14.540
No! It can't be the power of human partners!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.250
His Highness Maestro lost?

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:50.660
this is how it should be this is i was just a step away my dreams were

00:15:50.660 --> 00:16:00.000
supposed to come true why why did you smash my dreams what kind of

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:05.020
dream is it to want to destroy the momodo world when someone as strong as you can become king

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:13.490
on his own what do you know huh i suffered when the 100 momodo were sent to the human world for

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:26.260
the battle to become king i was dropped into this world by mistake figured out right away

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:30.000
that this wasn't the human world but at the same time i didn't know who

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:38.080
where I was. I had nowhere to go, so I just wandered around this world.

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:51.730
I realized, I realized that this was a land where criminals were sent.

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:56.730
I could not battle for king in the human world, and I could not return to the Momodo world.

00:16:56.730 --> 00:17:00.000
I was abandoned by the Momodo world.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:03.710
That's when I made a vow!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:08.200
To give up on going to the human world!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:13.280
And together with these forgotten Momodo, to take revenge on our home world!

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:20.340
Thanks to you, my ambitions end here.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:24.940
Forgive me if I don't cry at your sad story, Jerry.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:29.410
Race!

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:48.250
the rules satch you won fair and square but before i go i'll say one last thing if you want to open

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:55.650
the door to the human world get your spells to collide why are you telling us this i don't know

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:59.960
maybe i've grown to respect all of you now

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:05.420
I can return to that world that originally doomed me.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:09.720
To the accursed Momodo world, where I will finally be home.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:26.600
I don't approve of me, I don't approve of your ideas either!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:30.000
That's why I will get stronger!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:41.950
as you like it's been very interesting fighting alongside you two i'll be looking forward to

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:51.960
fighting against you soon yeah okay is everyone ready yes yeah ready let's go

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:30.000
human world

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:35.090
and comes down on Kyo, Zatch, and Ponygon's adventure in the In-Between World.

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:39.720
I'm not sure if I'm the only one who noticed or not,

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:44.210
but it seemed to me like the faces of the three who returned looked stronger.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:49.680
And I don't know how Zatch felt about having to fight together with Brago.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:57.790
However, I have a pretty good idea how Brago felt, Sherry.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:58.450
Hmm?

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:04.420
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.400
Hmm. I see.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.070
- Hey everybody, start wriggling.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.710
- What? This is our teacher?

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.820
- She's your new teacher, Miss Wriggle,

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:58.960
so we better listen to her and start wriggling.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.000
- I'm so happy

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.800
to see you all giving your best.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.800
That is what youth is all about.

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:06.140
- Nah, I am not going to wriggle!

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.180
- So, this is your idea of wriggling, huh, Keo?

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:11.420
- Let's see Keo wriggle his way out of this one

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.640
on the next Dutch Bell.
